quotes.tex:
For any $\targetlang\in\coll$ and any single-step adversarial exhaustion $\exhaustion{\advlang}$ with lower recall $\setlowerrecall{\exhaustion{\targetlang}}{\advlang}$ and upper recall $\setupperrecall{\exhaustion{\targetlang}}{\advlang}$, Algorithm~\ref{alg:gen-with-novelty} generating $\exhaustion{\guesslang} = \{\guesslang_n\}_{n=0}^\infty$ with $\guesslang_n \uparrow \guesslang$ achieves precision $1$ and recall
\begin{equation}
    \setlowerrecall{\exhaustion{\targetlang}}{\guesslang}\ge\ \max \Big( 1-\setupperrecall{\exhaustion{\targetlang}}{\advlang} , \frac{\setlowerrecall{\exhaustion{\targetlang}}{\advlang}}{3}\Big).
\end{equation}

