Let $\gamma\in[0,1]$. Given an adversarial exhaustion
$\exhaustion{\advlang}=\{\advlang_n\}_{n=0}^\infty$ and the generated exhaustion $\exhaustion{\guesslang}=\{\guesslang_n\}_{n=0}^\infty$, define
\begin{equation}
N_0 := \emptyset,
\qquad
N_n := N_{n-1}\cup
\bigl(\Delta\guesslang_n\setminus\advlang_n\bigr).
\end{equation}
We say that the generator is $\gamma$-novel if, for every $n$ with
$|\guesslang_n|>0$,
\begin{equation}
\frac{|N_n|}{|\guesslang_n|}\ge \gamma.
\end{equation}

